            <ArticleTitle>Coronary stent strut avulsion in aorto-ostial in-stent restenosis: potential complication after cutting balloon angioplasty.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>215-9</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>We report a case of stent strut avulsion by the cutting balloon during the withdrawal of the deflated balloon catheter in aorto-ostial in-stent restenosis, which was managed successfully by another stent. The proposed mechanisms and recommendations to avoid this rare complication are provided.</AbstractText>
